\newlabel{fig:rq1-limitations}{{5}{36}{Limitation breakdown for the 55 not\_detectable instances. Analysis-engine limitations (L1--L3, 21 cases) are precision losses internal to the abstract interpreter that no developer annotation can recover. Annotation-model limitations (L4--L5, 34 cases) are cases the interpreter would distinguish given the right annotation, but the current model cannot express that annotation (L4) or only with bug awareness (L5)}{figure.caption.24}{}}
